'''Li'l Cake Doge''' (ちびケーキわんこ, ''Chibi Kēki Wanko'', '''Chibi Cake Doggy''') is a [[:Category:Metal Enemies|Metal]] enemy that appears in [[CAT DAY]]. It was added in [[Version 8.9 Update|Version 8.9]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Li'l Cake Doge
|image = E 478.png
|appearance = [[CAT DAY]]
|money drop = 1¢ - 3¢
}}

==Enemy==
Li'l Cake Doge is a [[:Category:Metal Enemies|Metal]] enemy, however it has pitifully low health and damage, meaning it can be killed by practically anything aside from certain [[Attacks Only|limited target]] units.

==Strategy==
This enemy is essentially harmless. [[:Category:Critical Hit Cats|Critical Hitters]] like [[Catornado (Super Rare Cat)|Catornado]] are perfect for killing it quickly, but other units like [[Cow Cat (Normal Cat)|Cow Cat]] and [[Crazed Cow Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed Cow Cat]] can do the job just as well.

==Encounters==
